--- Options of a Trace, which define what it returns and how it is performed
declare enum TraceMode
    --- Whether to draw a 3D line representing the ray
    DrawDebug
    --- Whether should trace against complex collision
    TraceComplex
    --- Whether want to include the physical material in the results (adds `SurfaceType` to result)
    ReturnPhysicalMaterial
    --- Whether want to return the Entity hit (adds `Entity` to result)
    ReturnEntity
    --- Whether should return names (adds `ActorName`, `ComponentName` and `BoneName` to result)
    ReturnNames
    --- Whether want to trace and return UV information (adds `UV` to result)
    ReturnUV
    --- Whether should only trace for objects that don't ignore visibility collision channel
    TraceOnlyVisibility
    --- Whether should return extra data about item that was hit (hit primitive specific - usually the instanced index) (adds `Item` to result)
    ReturnItem
end

